@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5203

### Health check
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/health

### Login (demo credentials)
# @name login
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### List products (no auth required)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Get a single product with its items
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/1

### Create a product (requires the access token from the login call above)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "productName": "Standing Desk"
}

### Delete a product (Admin role required)
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
